# Go build cache and installed artefacts (GOPATH mode, see build-core.sh).
# bin/awgd.darwin-amd64 is NOT ignored: it's the prebuilt daemon, shipped so
# a fresh clone can run `make` without a Go 1.10 toolchain.
go-core/pkg/
go-core/bin/
*.test
*.out

